{%- comment -%}
  Widget "Compre Junto" da PDP.

  Lê tags `crosssell:<handle>` do produto atual, busca cada produto via
  /products/<handle>.js (client-side), monta uma lista com checkboxes
  e auto-match de variante com a do produto atual.

  Diferente do bundle clássico: NÃO tem botão "Adicionar ao carrinho"
  próprio nem o produto atual na lista. O cliente clica o CTA normal
  do PDP e os cross-sells marcados vão junto no mesmo POST /cart/add.js
  (interceptado pelo submit handler em sections/product.liquid).

  Não renderiza se: produto tem `crosssell:none`/`no-crosssell`,
  nenhuma tag `crosssell:*` válida, ou nenhum cross-sell em estoque.

  Limite de 4 cross-sells.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="pdp-bundle" data-pdp-bundle hidden>
  <h3 class="pdp-bundle__title">Compre Junto</h3>
  <p class="pdp-bundle__subtitle">Adicione com 1 clique ao seu pedido</p>
  <ul class="pdp-bundle__list" data-pdp-bundle-list></ul>
</div>

<script type="application/json" data-pdp-bundle-config>
  {
    "currentHandle": {{ product.handle | json }},
    "tags": {{ product.tags | json }}
  }
</script>

<style>
  .pdp-bundle {
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    background: var(--color-surface, #fff);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant, #e6dad1);
    border-radius: 12px;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }
  .pdp-bundle[hidden] { display: none; }
  .pdp-bundle__title {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
    color: var(--color-on-background, #201b14);
  }
  .pdp-bundle__subtitle {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--text-muted, #6b6259);
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }
  .pdp-bundle__list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .pdp-bundle__item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.625rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.625rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant, #e6dad1);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--color-surface, #fff);
    transition: opacity 0.15s;
  }
  .pdp-bundle__item.is-unchecked { opacity: 0.5; }
  .pdp-bundle__check {
    width: 1.125rem;
    height: 1.125rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    accent-color: var(--color-primary, #5a4742);
  }
  .pdp-bundle__img {
    width: 3rem;
    height: 3rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    object-fit: cover;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    background: var(--color-surface-container, #f8ece0);
  }
  .pdp-bundle__info {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .pdp-bundle__name {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--color-on-background, #201b14);
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
  }
  .pdp-bundle__variant-label {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    color: var(--text-muted, #6b6259);
    margin: 0.125rem 0 0;
  }
  .pdp-bundle__price {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0;
    white-space: nowrap;
    color: var(--color-on-background, #201b14);
  }
  .pdp-bundle__variants {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    margin-top: 0.375rem;
  }
  .pdp-bundle__variant-btn {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    padding: 0.1875rem 0.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant, #e6dad1);
    background: transparent;
    border-radius: 999px;
    cursor: pointer;
    color: var(--color-on-background, #201b14);
    transition: background 0.15s, color 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
  }
  .pdp-bundle__variant-btn:hover {
    background: var(--color-surface-container, #f8ece0);
  }
  .pdp-bundle__variant-btn[aria-pressed="true"] {
    background: var(--color-primary, #5a4742);
    color: #fff;
    border-color: var(--color-primary, #5a4742);
  }
  .pdp-bundle__variant-btn[disabled] {
    opacity: 0.4;
    cursor: not-allowed;
    text-decoration: line-through;
  }
</style>

<script src="{{ 'ame-pdp-bundle.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
